ots</span>\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td><span class=\"nowrap\"><small>演化支</small>：</span>\n</td>\n<td><span class=\"nowrap\"><a href=\"/wiki/%E8%94%B7%E8%96%87%E7%B1%BB%E6%A4%8D%E7%89%A9\" title=\"薔薇類植物\">薔薇類植物</a> Rosids</span>\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td><span class=\"nowrap\">目：</span>\n</td>\n<td><span class=\"nowrap\"><a href=\"/wiki/%E8%91%AB%E8%8A%A6%E7%9B%AE\" title=\"葫蘆目\">葫蘆目</a> Cucurbitales</span>\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td><span class=\"nowrap\">科：</span>\n</td>\n<td><span class=\"nowrap\"><a href=\"/wiki/%E8%91%AB%E8%8A%A6%E7%A7%91\" title=\"葫蘆科\">葫蘆科</a> Cucurbitaceae</span>\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td><span class=\"nowrap\">亞科：</span>\n</td>\n<td><span class=\"nowrap\"><a href=\"/w/index.php?title=%E8%91%AB%E8%8A%A6%E4%BA%9A%E7%A7%91&amp;action=edit&amp;redlink=1\" class=\"new\" title=\"葫蘆亞科（頁面不存在）\">葫蘆亞科</a> Cucurbitoideae</span>\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td><span class=\"nowrap\">族：</span>\n</td>\n<td><span class=\"nowrap\"><a href=\"/w/index.php?title=%E5%8D%97%E7%93%9C%E6%97%8F&amp;action=edit&amp;redlink=1\" class=\"new\" title=\"南瓜族（頁面不存在）\">南瓜族</a> Cucurbiteae</span>\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td><span class=\"nowrap\">屬：</span>\n</td>\n<td><span class=\"nowrap\"><b>南瓜屬 <i>Cucurbita</i></b></span><br /><small><a href=\"/wiki/L.\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"L.\">L.</a>, 1753</small>\n</td></tr>\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n<tr>\n<th colspan=\"2\" style=\"text-align: center; background-color: rgb(180,250,180)\"><a href=\"/wiki/%E6%A8%A1%E5%BC%8F%E7%A8%AE\" title=\"模式種\">模式種</a>\n</th></tr>\n<tr>\n<td colspan=\"2\" style=\"text-align: center\"><a href=\"/wiki/%E7%BE%8E%E6%B4%B2%E5%8D%97%E7%93%9C\" title=\"美洲南瓜\">美洲南瓜</a><br /><i>Cucurbita pepo</i><br /><div style=\"font-size: 85%;\"><a href=\"/wiki/L.\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"L.\">L.</a>, 1753</div>\n</td></tr>\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n<tr>\n<th colspan=\"2\" style=\"text-align: center; background-color: rgb(180,250,180)\"><a href=\"/wiki/%E7%94%9F%E7%89%A9%E5%A4%9A%E6%A8%A3%E6%80%A7\" title=\"生物多樣性\">多樣性</a><sup id=\"cite&#95;ref-powo&#95;1-0\" class=\"reference\"><a href=\"#cite_note-powo-1\"><span class=\"cite-bracket\">&#91;</span>1<span class=\"cite-bracket\">&#93;</span></a></sup> \n</th></tr>\n<tr>\n<td colspan=\"2\" style=\"text-align: center\"><a href=\"#分類\">約17種</a>\n</td></tr>\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n</tbody></table><style data-mw-deduplicate=\"TemplateStyles:r95173204\">@media(max-width:640px){body:not(.skin-minerva) .mw-parser-output .infobox{width:100%!important}body:not(.skin-minerva) .mw-parser-output .infobox th{width:50%}}@media screen{html.skin-theme-clientpref-night .mw-parser-output .infobox.biota tr{background:transparent!important}html.skin-theme-clientpref-night .mw-parser-output .infobox.biota img{background:transparent}}@media screen and (prefers-color-scheme:dark){html.skin-theme-clientpref-os .mw-parser-output .infobox.biota tr{background:transparent!important}html.skin-theme-clientpref-os .mw-parser-output .infobox.biota img{background:white}}.mw-parser-output .infobox.biota .taxobox-edit-taxonomy img{background:transparent!important}body.skin-vector .mw-parser-output table.biota.infobox{margin-top:0.5em}body.skin--responsive .mw-parser-output table.biota.infobox tr.taxonrow2 td{padding:2px 10px}</style>\n<p><b>南瓜屬</b>（<a href=\"/wiki/%E5%AD%A6%E5%90%8D\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"學名\">學名</a>：<i><span title=\"拉丁語文本\"><span lang=\"la\">Cucurbita</span></span></i>）是<a href=\"/wiki/%E8%91%AB%E8%98%86%E7%9B%AE\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"葫蘆目\">葫蘆目</a><a href=\"/wiki/%E8%91%AB%E8%98%86%E7%A7%91\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"葫蘆科\">葫蘆科</a>的其中一<a href=\"/wiki/%E5%B1%AC\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"屬\">屬</a><sup id=\"cite&#95;ref-powo&#95;1-1\" class=\"reference\"><a href=\"#cite_note-powo-1\"><span class=\"cite-bracket\">&#91;</span>1<span class=\"cite-bracket\">&#93;</span></a></sup>，原生於<a href=\"/wiki/%E7%BE%8E%E6%B4%B2\" title=\"美洲\">美洲</a> <sup id=\"cite&#95;ref-powo&#95;1-2\" class=\"reference\"><a href=\"#cite_note-powo-1\"><span class=\"cite-bracket\">&#91;</span>1<span class=\"cite-bracket\">&#93;</span></a></sup>，其果實通稱為南瓜（泛稱，相當於英文的<span title=\"英語文本\"><span lang=\"en\">squash</span></span>），包括了<a href=\"/wiki/%E4%B8%AD%E5%9B%BD%E5%8D%97%E7%93%9C\" title=\"中國南瓜\">中國南瓜</a>、<a href=\"/wiki/%E7%BE%8E%E5%9C%8B%E5%8D%97%E7%93%9C\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"美國南瓜\">美國南瓜</a>、<a href=\"/wiki/%E7%AC%8B%E7%93%9C\" title=\"筍瓜\">筍瓜</a>等食用物種。南瓜按收穫時間可分為夏南瓜（嫩果）和冬南瓜（老熟果）。前者是在果實未成熟、外皮未長硬時收穫，以<a href=\"/wiki/%E7%BE%8E%E6%B4%B2%E5%8D%97%E7%93%9C\" title=\"美洲南瓜\">美洲南瓜</a>栽培種為主，代表有<a href=\"/wiki/%E8%A5%BF%E8%91%AB%E8%8A%A6\" title=\"西葫蘆\">西葫蘆</a>。後者則是在果實成熟後收穫，包含狹義的<a href=\"/wiki/%E5%8D%97%E7%93%9C\" title=\"南瓜\">南瓜</a>（相當於英文的<span title=\"英語文本\"><span lang=\"en\">pumpkin</span></span>）。\n</p>\n<div class=\"mw-heading mw-heading2\"><h2 id=\"分類\"><span id=\".E5.88.86.E9.A1.9E\"></span>分類</h2><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/w/index.php?title=%E5%8D%97%E7%93%9C%E5%B1%AC&amp;action=edit&amp;section=1\" title=\"編輯章節：分類\"><span>編輯</span></a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></div>\n<p>本屬已知有17個<a href=\"/wiki/%E7%89%A9%E7%A8%AE\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"物種\">物種</a>，如下<sup id=\"cite&#95;ref-powo&#95;1-3\" class=\"reference\"><a href=\"#cite_note-powo-1\"><span class=\"cite-bracket\">&#91;</span>1<span class=\"cite-bracket\">&#93;</span></a></sup>：\n</p>\n<style data-mw-deduplicate=\"TemplateStyles:r79074265\">.mw-parser-output .div-col{margin-top:0.3em;column-width:30em}.mw-parser-output .div-col-small{font-size:90%}.mw-parser-output .div-col-rules{column-rule:1px solid #aaa}.mw-parser-output .div-col dl,.mw-parser-output .div-col ol,.mw-parser-output .div-col ul{margin-top:0}.mw-parser-output .div-col li,.mw-parser-output .div-col dd{page-break-inside:avoid;break-inside:avoid-column}.mw-parser-output .plainlist ol,.mw-parser-output .plainlist ul{line-height:inherit;list-style:none;margin:0}.mw-parser-output .plainlist ol li,.mw-parser-output .plainlist ul li{margin-bottom:0}</style><div class=\"div-col\" style=\"column-count:3; column-width:auto;\">\n<ul><li><a href=\"/w/index.php?title=%E5%AE%89%E5%9C%B0%E5%8D%97%E7%93%9C&amp;action=edit&amp;redlink=1\" class=\"new\" title=\"安地南瓜（頁面不存在）\">安地南瓜</a> <i>Cucurbita andreana</i><small> Naudin</small></li>\n<li><a href=\"/wiki/%E7%81%B0%E7%B1%BD%E5%8D%97%E7%93%9C\" title=\"灰籽南瓜\">灰籽南瓜</a> <i>Cucurbita argyrosperma</i><small> C.Huber</small></li>\n<li><a href=\"/w/index.php?title=%E5%BF%83%E5%BD%A2%E5%8D%97%E7%93%9C&amp;action=edit&amp;redlink=1\" class=\"new\" title=\"心形南瓜（頁面不存在）\">心形南瓜</a> <i>Cucurbita cordata</i><small> S.Watson</small></li>\n<li><a href=\"/w/index.php?title=%E5%9C%86%E7%AD%92%E5%8D%97%E7%93%9C&amp;action=edit&amp;redlink=1\" class=\"new\" title=\"圓筒南瓜（頁面不存在）\">圓筒南瓜</a> <i>Cucurbita cylindrata</i><small> L.H.Bailey</small></li>\n<li><a href=\"/w/index.php?title=%E6%8C%87%E5%8F%B6%E5%8D%97%E7%93%9C&amp;action=edit&amp;redlink=1\" class=\"new\" title=\"指葉南瓜（頁面不存在）\">指葉南瓜</a> <i>Cucurbita digitata</i><small> A.Gray</small></li>\n<li><a href=\"/w/index.php?title=%E5%8E%84%E7%93%9C%E5%A4%9A%E5%B0%94%E5%8D%97%E7%93%9C&amp;action=edit&amp;redlink=1\" class=\"new\" title=\"厄瓜多南瓜（頁面不存在）\">厄瓜多南瓜</a> <i>Cucurbita ecuadorensis</i><small> Cutler &amp; Whitaker</small></li>\n<li><a href=\"/wiki/%E9%AD%9A%E7%BF%85%E7%93%9C\" title=\"魚翅瓜\">魚翅瓜</a> <i>Cucurbita ficifolia</i><small> Bouché</small></li>\n<li><a href=\"/w/index.php?title=%E6%97%B1%E5%9C%B0%E6%B2%B9%E7%93%9C&amp;action=edit&amp;redlink=1\" class=\"new\" title=\"旱地油瓜（頁面不存在）\">旱地油瓜</a> <i>Cucurbita foetidissima</i><small> Kunth</small></li>\n<li><a href=\"/w/index.php?title=%E5%8A%A0%E5%88%A9%E5%A5%A5%E8%BF%AA%E6%B0%8F%E5%8D%97%E7%93%9C&amp;action=edit&amp;redlink=1\" class=\"new\" title=\"加利奧迪氏南瓜（頁面不存在）\">加利奧迪氏南瓜</a> <i>Cucurbita galeottii</i><small> Cogn.</small></li>\n<li><a href=\"/w/index.php?title=%E4%BC%A6%E4%BB%A3%E5%88%A9%E4%BA%9A%E5%8D%97%E7%93%9C&amp;action=edit&amp;redlink=1\" class=\"new\" title=\"倫代利亞南瓜（頁面不存在）\">倫代利亞南瓜</a> <i>Cucurbita lundelliana</i><small> L.H.Bailey</small></li>\n<li><a href=\"/wiki/%E7%AC%8B%E7%93%9C\" title=\"筍瓜\">筍瓜</a> <i>Cucurbita maxima</i><small> Duchesne</small></li>\n<li><a href=\"/wiki/%E7%94%B0%E9%87%8E%E5%8D%97%E7%93%9C\" title=\"田野南瓜\">田野南瓜</a> <i>Cucurbita melopepo</i><small> L.</small></li>\n<li><a href=\"/wiki/%E4%B8%AD%E5%9B%BD%E5%8D%97%E7%93%9C\" title=\"中國南瓜\">中國南瓜</a> <i>Cucurbita moschata</i><small> Duchesne</small></li>\n<li><a href=\"/w/index.php?title=%E5%A5%A5%E5%9F%BA%E4%B9%94%E6%AF%94%E6%B9%96%E5%8D%97%E7%93%9C&amp;action=edit&amp;redlink=1\" class=\"new\" title=\"奧基喬比湖南瓜（頁面不存在）\">奧基喬比湖南瓜</a> <i>Cucurbita okeechobeensis</i><small> (Small) L.H.Bailey</small></li>\n<li><a href=\"/wiki/%E6%8E%8C%E8%91%89%E5%8D%97%E7%93%9C\" title=\"掌葉南瓜\">掌葉南瓜</a> <i>Cucurbita palmata</i><small> S.Watson</small></li>\n<li><a href=\"/w/index.php?title=%E8%B6%B3%E8%91%89%E5%8D%97%E7%93%9C&amp;action=edit&amp;redlink=1\" class=\"new\" title=\"足葉南瓜（頁面不存在）\">足葉南瓜</a> <i>Cucurbita pedatifolia</i><small> L.H.Bailey</small></li>\n<li><a href=\"/wiki/%E7%BE%8E%E6%B4%B2%E5%8D%97%E7%93%9C\" title=\"美洲南瓜\">美洲南瓜</a> <i>Cucurbita pepo</i><small> L.</small></li>\n<li><a href=\"/w/index.php?title=%E6%89%8E%E6%A0%B9%E5%8D%97%E7%93%9C&amp;action=edit&amp;redlink=1\" class=\"new\" title=\"扎根南瓜（頁面不存在）\">扎根南瓜</a> <i>Cucurbita radicans</i><small> Naudin</small></li></ul>\n</div>\n<div class=\"mw-heading mw-heading3\"><h3 id=\"雜交種\"><span id=\".E9.9B.9C.E4.BA.A4.E7.A8.AE\"></span>雜交種</h3><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/w/index.php?title=%E5%8D%97%E7%93%9C%E5%B1%AC&amp;action=edit&amp;section=2\" title=\"編輯章節：雜交種\"><span>編輯</span></a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></di